The '''Pooter''' wanders very slowly around the room to the point where they stay put, and they shoot one bullet at Isaac. Pooters will not shoot if Isaac wears {{i|Skatole}}. A {{E|Fly}} can turn into a Pooter if it stays near {{E|Poop}} for long enough.
{{clear}}

== Variants ==
=== Super Pooter ===
{{infobox monster
 | name           = Super Pooter
 | variant        = 1
 | base hp        = 8
