The Super Pooter behaves like the Pooter, except that it shoots two bullets in a V-shaped pattern. Just like the Pooter, it also does not shoot Isaac with {{i|Skatole}}.
{{clear}}

=== Tainted Pooter ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Tainted Pooter
 | variant     = 2
 | base hp     = 75
 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}<br>Found on the [[Ascent]] to {{s|Home}}.
 | behavior    = Slowly drifts toward Isaac, occasionally firing four blood shots at him that split into two smaller ones when they hit a wall or obstacle.
}}

Tainted Pooters are corrupt and much tankier versions of Pooters. They move the same as Pooters, slowly drifting towards Isaac, however instead of firing just one blood shot at him, they shoot 4 big shots that become 2 smaller ones when in contact with a wall or obstacle.

They are exclusive to the [[Ascent]] to {{s|Home}}.
{{clear}}{{dlc clear}}

